A78. Old Spanish hanging. ~ MOSS

D1. What the prodigal son said he would do first. ~ ARISE
D2. Feudal servant problems. ~ VASSALS
D3. A good place to keep your straw hat. ~ ON
D4. A little girl who ought to be able to tuck it. ~ NAN
D5. What a wiseguy always is. ~ SAPIENT
D6. Beed. ~ SPELLED
D7. What Bobby Jones has been under since childhood. ~ PAR
D8. Roman ivory. ~ OS
D9. What she was after six weeks of dieting. ~ STOUTER
D10. The kind of language you used to hear in conference. ~ TERSE
